": 1784678400, "platform": 6, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1816898, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxe.jpg"}, {"id": 1816897, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxd.jpg"}, {"id": 1816899, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxf.jpg"}, {"id": 1816900, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxg.jpg"}, {"id": 1816901, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxh.jpg"}, {"id": 1816895, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxb.jpg"}, {"id": 1816896, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12xxc.jpg"}], "slug": "scales-of-silence", "storyline": "A world of plains and peaks, rivers and fire, where two ancient factions of serpents wage an endless war. The Order seeks unity. The Fangs believe only separation and relentless growth bring true survival. But where conflict runs deepest, dark portals tear open at nightfall, and a living darkness called The Writhing spills through, consuming everything it touches.", "summary": "Clear the couch for co-op snake. A local party game where length is your life: up to 8 players on one shared screen for PvP battles, plus a 2-player co-op campaign.\n\nEvery hit costs you tail. Stay longer than your opponent, grind them down to nothing, and rack up +3 points per takedown. Shrink your friends before they shrink you.\n\nBeneath it all runs an ancient war between serpents, and a living darkness feeding on the conflict. The campaign crosses ten biomes that change the rules: forests choke your sightlines, frozen wastes starve you, swamps poison most of your food, volcanoes stay in permanent darkness. Yes, this is a snake game. It just has more to say.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/scales-of-silence", "videos": [{"id": 181100, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "8lj8oTl9Mzs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8lj8oTl9Mzs", "title": "Scales of Silence - Announcement Trailer | 8-Player Couch Co-Op Snake Game", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8lj8oTl9Mzs/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 188562, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "9US-6tDeps0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9US-6tDeps0", "title": "Scales of Silence - Couch Party Game Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9US-6tDeps0/fhddefault.jpg"}]}